# Context

## Background
Niko asked for a review of the look and feel. Screenshots of 14 screens
showed that the illustrated assets were good, but most screens used the
default Godot look and the city was one repeated tile.

## Why this way
Phase 1 of a three-phase plan: code-only fixes first (theme, streets,
cafe, minigames, wake burst). New illustrated assets come in phase 2.

## Gotchas
- After a change to ChalkTheme.build(), regenerate
  resources/ui/chalk_theme.tres with ResourceSaver.save(). Otherwise
  test_chalk_theme fails.
- Do not set gui/theme/custom_font. It brings back the thin weight-200
  Nunito.
- Street props and cafe furniture are draw-only. They never collide.
